        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ Yesua mwana wa Yosataki waũngamie, vamwe na athembi ana‐a‐ĩthe make, na Nzeluvaveli mwana wa Sealitieli, na ana‐a‐ĩthe make, na maaka kĩthembeo kya Ngai wa Isilaeli, mathembe nthembo sya kũvĩvw’a ĩũlũ wakyo, o tondũ kũandĩkĩtwe mĩaonĩ ya Mose mũndũ wa Ngai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
