              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na malilikana mboka ya malwanda, o tondũ kũandĩkĩtwe, na mathemba nthembo sya kũvĩvw’a sya kĩla mũthenya kwa ũtalo wasyo, kwĩanana na ũtw’ĩo, o tondũ kwaaĩlĩte kwĩkawa kĩla mũthenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
