        {
          "text": "ũndũ andũ mataĩ matonya kũvathũkan’ya kĩlonzo kya wasya wa ũtanu na kĩlonzo kya kũĩa kwa andũ; nũndũ andũ mookĩlilye wasya mũnene, na kĩlonzo nĩkyeew’ĩkie kũasa.",
